    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbafcStaffalsoa]{Staff}, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>As a Bonus Action, you can turn the head of this staff into that of an animate, venomous snake for 1 minute or revert the staff to its inanimate form.</p><p>When you take the Attack action, you can make one of the attack rolls using the animated snake head, which has a reach of 5 feet. Apply your Proficiency Bonus and Wisdom modifier to the attack roll. On a hit, the target takes 1d6 Piercing damage and 3d6 Poison damage.</p><p>The snake head can be attacked while it is animate. It has AC 15, HP 20, and Immunity to Poison and Psychic damage. If the head drops to 0 Hit Points, the staff is destroyed. As long as it’s not destroyed, the staff regains all lost Hit Points when it reverts to its inanimate form.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-EZ93ZYgbU0hLynAI\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Animate Snake Head</em> applique l’effet de la tête animée pour 1 minute ; retirez-le pour rendre au bâton sa forme inerte. Les points de vie de la tête sont à suivre à la main.</p></section>",
